{
  "name": "Request a review on WhatsApp after delivery with an approved template",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "9c546f13-a1d8-4b26-9e42-0841ce583b39",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ask for a review on WhatsApp after delivery\n\n### How it works\nThis workflow helps shops ask for one review a few days after an order is delivered, only when the customer opted in. Your shop POSTs order_id, phone, name and marketing_opt_in when an order is delivered. A Code node validates the event and the opt-in flag and the webhook answers at once. The workflow waits (default 3 days), sends an approved template with a review link button and logs the request in Google Sheets.\n\nA request days later is outside the 24 hour window, so it must be an approved template. Meta may classify it as marketing, which costs more than utility and needs marketing opt-in: ask for that at checkout. Send once per order, honour opt-outs, and do not reward only positive reviews.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a template review_request with one body variable (name) and a URL button with a variable suffix, for example https://example.com/review/{{1}}. Wait for approval.\n2. Add WhatsApp Business Cloud and Google Sheets credentials. Set your phone number id and spreadsheet (tab \"Review requests\": order_id, phone, sent_at, message_id).\n\n### Customization\nChange the wait time in the Wait node.",
        "height": 700,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d562944d-ddda-459a-ade2-0156a3a0ae4c",
      "name": "Section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Validate, wait, send, log",
        "height": 60,
        "width": 1580,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "33c218d7-23e8-4589-8fc9-20f9456e8b01",
      "name": "Delivered webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -40,
        160
      ],
      "webhookId": "b8728f5a-5a1c-4a19-9d82-571b41f39487",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "whatsapp-review-request",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aa46f4b7-777c-4dec-b9fd-482f31d776f8",
      "name": "Validate event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const b = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\nconst phone = String(b.phone || '').replace(/\\D/g, '');\nconst ok = phone.length >= 8 && !!b.order_id && (b.marketing_opt_in === true || b.marketing_opt_in === 'true');\nreturn [{ json: {\n  ok, order_id: String(b.order_id || ''), phone, name: String(b.name || 'there').trim(),\n  // value for the template's URL button variable (appended to your fixed review URL)\n  review_suffix: encodeURIComponent(String(b.order_id || '')),\n  lang: b.lang || 'en',\n  error: ok ? '' : 'Missing phone or order_id, or no marketing opt-in',\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7242d4e5-c814-4a2a-86df-ce5b1c65c99b",
      "name": "Valid and opted in?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "0064f12e-52e6-4eb8-a516-e5197819e843",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8cc5399a-118b-4bac-9670-2a4a99949d31",
      "name": "Respond accepted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        680,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"ok\": true } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b42869a3-f6c7-42f1-902d-eb61dad2bf17",
      "name": "Wait 3 days",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        920,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "f485b77e-a39e-4315-98bd-92ab984aa22b",
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 3,
        "unit": "days"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8fd07d06-8595-4425-bbe5-d559560041ef",
      "name": "Send review template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1160,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "operation": "sendTemplate",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $('Validate event').item.json.phone }}",
        "template": "={{ 'review_request|' + $('Validate event').item.json.lang }}",
        "components": {
          "component": [
            {
              "type": "body",
              "bodyParameters": {
                "parameter": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "={{ $('Validate event').item.json.name }}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "button",
              "sub_type": "url",
              "index": 0,
              "buttonParameters": {
                "parameter": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "={{ $('Validate event').item.json.review_suffix }}"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "49c06be9-71b1-44a2-9441-80cd4e83c44a",
      "name": "Build log row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1400,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const src = $('Validate event').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  order_id: src.order_id, phone: src.phone,\n  sent_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n  message_id: $input.first().json.messages?.[0]?.id || '',\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "98948952-dc04-464c-ac0d-205c83597973",
      "name": "Log request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
